# @hub-lanes

# ── ARCHIE QUEUE DOCTOR LANE (BH-4584) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Every 10 minutes Archie reads each project's merge queue and the conductor's
# rows: a PR merged on GitHub but logged ejected is settled MERGED, a stale
# dependency hold or WAIT_CI row is corrected, a failed Mergify batch's members
# are solo-run on the CI pool and only a reproducing one is BLOCKed, and an
# approved, green, clean PR nobody enqueued is enqueued once. Every action is an
# archie_actions row claimed before any write; flock -n dedupes. Off:
# ARCHIE_FMQ_ENABLED=0, flags/lane-off-archie-fm-queue,
# bin/harness-ctl.sh off archie-fm-queue, or the settings row archie.manage=off.
*/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/archie-fm-queue.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
